cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use mammo-aligner in your research, please cite the version you used."
type: software
title: "mammo-aligner"
abstract: >-
  A minimal Python library that reads the orientation of a mammogram (FFDM,
  synthetic 2D, or DBT) from its DICOM metadata and realigns the image, and
  points or boxes on it, into a common frame.
authors:
  - family-names: Brown-Mulry
    given-names: Beatrice
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-11-23"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/beatrice-b-m/mammo-aligner"
keywords:
  - mammography
  - digital breast tomosynthesis
  - DICOM
  - image orientation
  - medical imaging
